id: SCA-032
title: CMake file(DOWNLOAD) without hash verification
category: supply-chain
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: CMakeLists.txt
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: DOWNLOAD
patterns:
  - regex: file\s*\(\s*DOWNLOAD\s+
    message: CMake file(DOWNLOAD) fetches files at configure time. Without EXPECTED_HASH, a compromised server can deliver malicious content.
fix: Always use file(DOWNLOAD url file EXPECTED_HASH SHA256=<hash>). Pin the hash of every downloaded file.
